{
  "page": 597,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 6099,
      "text": "By the fig and the olive[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 95,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التِّينِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Fig",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 537,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6100,
      "text": "and by Mount Sinai[2],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 95,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التِّينِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Fig",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 537,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6101,
      "text": "and by this secure city [of Makkah][3],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 95,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التِّينِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Fig",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 537,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6102,
      "text": "Surely We have created man in the best form[4],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 95,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التِّينِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Fig",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 537,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6103,
      "text": "then We will reduce him to the lowest of the low[5],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 95,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التِّينِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Fig",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 537,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6104,
      "text": "except those who believe and do righteous deeds; they will have a never-ending reward.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 95,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التِّينِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Fig",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 537,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6105,
      "text": "Then, what makes you deny the Judgment Day?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 95,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التِّينِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Fig",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 537,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6106,
      "text": "Is not Allah the Most Just of all judges?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 95,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التِّينِ",
        "englishName": "At-Tin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Fig",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 537,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6107,
      "text": "Read in the name of your Lord Who created,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6108,
      "text": "created man from a clinging clot.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6109,
      "text": "Read, and your Lord is the Most Generous,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6110,
      "text": "Who taught by the pen,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6111,
      "text": "taught man what he did not know[1].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6112,
      "text": "Indeed, man transgresses",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6113,
      "text": "when he deems himself to be self-sufficient.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6114,
      "text": "Indeed, to your Lord is the return.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6115,
      "text": "Have you seen the one who prevents[2]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6116,
      "text": "a slave [of Allah] from praying[3]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6117,
      "text": "What if this [slave] is rightly guided,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6118,
      "text": "and enjoins righteousness?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6119,
      "text": "How about the one who denies and turns away[4]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6120,
      "text": "Does he not know that Allah is watching all?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6121,
      "text": "No indeed; if he does not desist, We will surely drag him by the forelock[5]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6122,
      "text": "a lying, sinful forelock[6].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6123,
      "text": "So let him call his associates;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6124,
      "text": "We will call the wardens of Hellfire[7].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 597,
      "ruku": 538,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6125,
      "text": "No indeed; do not obey him, but prostrate and draw near [to Allah].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 96,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَلَقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Alaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Clot",
        "numberOfAyahs": 19,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
